{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14137","headline":"秋日感怀 · 戎昱","name":"秋日感怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳岐路信悠悠，无事辞家两度秋。\n日下未驰千里足，天涯徒泛五湖舟。\n菏衣半浸缘乡泪，玉貌潜销是客愁。\n说向长安亲与故，谁怜岁晚尚淹留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14137.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14137","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}